{"seq":2,"slug":"finalizers-ownership","title":"Finalizers 与所有权管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/finalizers-ownership","wordCount":1210,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"finalizers-与所有权管理\">Finalizers 与所有权管理</h1><p>Finalizer 和 OwnerReference 是 Kubernetes 资源生命周期管理的两大基础机制。Finalizer 实现<strong>删除前清理</strong>——确保外部资源在 Kubernetes 对象删除前被正确清理；OwnerReference 实现<strong>级联删除</strong>——当父资源删除时自动清理子资源。Operator 开发者必须精确理解这两个机制的交互，否则极易引发资源泄漏或删除死锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Finalizer</strong>：对象删除前的清理钩子——设置 deletionTimestamp 后对象进入 Terminating 状态，控制器执行清理后移除 Finalizer 允许真正删除</li>\n<li><strong>OwnerReference</strong>：父子关系声明，父删除时子自动级联删除（由 Garbage Collector 执行）</li>\n<li><strong>Controller Owner</strong>：唯一的控制器所有者（<code>controller: true</code>），其变更触发子资源调谐</li>\n<li><strong>级联策略</strong>：Background（父先删）、Foreground（子先删）、Orphan（子保留）</li>\n<li><strong>跨 Namespace 限制</strong>：OwnerReference 不跨 namespace，跨 namespace 资源管理必须用 Finalizer + 手动清理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"finalizer-工作原理\">Finalizer 工作原理</h2><p>当一个带有 Finalizer 的资源被删除时，API Server 不会立即从 etcd 移除该对象——而是设置 <code>metadata.deletionTimestamp</code> 并保持对象可见。控制器检测到 <code>deletionTimestamp</code> 非空后执行清理逻辑，完成后移除 Finalizer。当所有 Finalizer 被移除后，API Server 才真正删除该对象。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户执行 kubectl delete] --&gt; B[API Server 设置 deletionTimestamp]&#10;    B --&gt; C{存在 Finalizer?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[立即删除对象]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[对象进入 Terminating 状态]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Controller 检测 deletionTimestamp]&#10;    F --&gt; G[执行清理: 删除外部资源]&#10;    G --&gt; H{清理成功?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[移除 Finalizer]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[重试 / 报错]&#10;    I --&gt; K{还有其他 Finalizer?}&#10;    K --&gt;|否| D&#10;    K --&gt;|是| E&#10;    J --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户执行 kubectl delete] --&gt; B[API Server 设置 deletionTimestamp]\n    B --&gt; C{存在 Finalizer?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[立即删除对象]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[对象进入 Terminating 状态]\n    E --&gt; F[Controller 检测 deletionTimestamp]\n    F --&gt; G[执行清理: 删除外部资源]\n    G --&gt; H{清理成功?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[移除 Finalizer]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[重试 / 报错]\n    I --&gt; K{还有其他 Finalizer?}\n    K --&gt;|否| D\n    K --&gt;|是| E\n    J --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"reconciler-中的-finalizer-模式\">Reconciler 中的 Finalizer 模式</h2><p>标准的 Finalizer 处理流程嵌入在 Reconcile 函数的头部：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"const finalizerName = &quot;database.example.com/cleanup&quot;&#10;&#10;func (r *DatabaseReconciler) Reconcile(ctx context.Context, req ctrl.Request) (ctrl.Result, error) {&#10;    var db databasev1.Database&#10;    if err := r.Get(ctx, req.NamespacedName, &amp;db); err != nil {&#10;        return ctrl.Result{}, client.IgnoreNotFound(err)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 检查是否正在被删除&#10;    if !db.DeletionTimestamp.IsZero() {&#10;        // 对象正在删除——执行清理&#10;        if controllerutil.ContainsFinalizer(&amp;db, finalizerName) {&#10;            if err := r.cleanupExternalResources(ctx, &amp;db); err != nil {&#10;                return ctrl.Result{}, err  // 清理失败，重试&#10;            }&#10;            // 清理成功，移除 Finalizer&#10;            controllerutil.RemoveFinalizer(&amp;db, finalizerName)&#10;            if err := r.Update(ctx, &amp;db); err != nil {&#10;                return ctrl.Result{}, err&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return ctrl.Result{}, nil  // 等待 GC 完成删除&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 对象未被删除——确保 Finalizer 存在&#10;    if !controllerutil.ContainsFinalizer(&amp;db, finalizerName) {&#10;        controllerutil.AddFinalizer(&amp;db, finalizerName)&#10;        if err := r.Update(ctx, &amp;db); err != nil {&#10;            return ctrl.Result{}, err&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 正常调谐逻辑...&#10;    return r.reconcileNormal(ctx, &amp;db)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> finalizerName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"database.example.com/cleanup\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseReconciler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reconcile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, req.NamespacedName, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IgnoreNotFound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查是否正在被删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db.DeletionTimestamp.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IsZero</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 对象正在删除——执行清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controllerutil.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ContainsFinalizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, finalizerName) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cleanupExternalResources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, err  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 清理失败，重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 清理成功，移除 Finalizer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            controllerutil.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RemoveFinalizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, finalizerName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 等待 GC 完成删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 对象未被删除——确保 Finalizer 存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">controllerutil.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ContainsFinalizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, finalizerName) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        controllerutil.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AddFinalizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db, finalizerName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 正常调谐逻辑...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reconcileNormal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>Finalizer 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>创建时</td>\n<td>添加 Finalizer（首次调谐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正常调谐</td>\n<td>Finalizer 存在，不影响逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除时</td>\n<td>检测 deletionTimestamp，执行清理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理成功</td>\n<td>移除 Finalizer，允许 GC 删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清理失败</td>\n<td>保留 Finalizer，返回错误触发重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"finalizer-的常见陷阱\">Finalizer 的常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>死锁场景一：清理逻辑依赖已删除的资源</strong></p>\n<p>如果 Finalizer 的清理逻辑需要读取同一 namespace 中的其他资源（如 Secret），而这些资源在 namespace 删除时已经被先清理，Finalizer 将永远无法完成——对象卡在 Terminating 状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 危险模式：清理逻辑依赖同 namespace 的 Secret&#10;func (r *Reconciler) cleanup(ctx context.Context, db *Database) error {&#10;    secret := &amp;corev1.Secret{}&#10;    // 如果 namespace 正在删除，这个 Secret 可能已经不存在了&#10;    err := r.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{&#10;        Namespace: db.Namespace,&#10;        Name: db.Spec.CredentialsRef,&#10;    }, secret)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return err  // 永远失败 → 永远卡住&#10;    }&#10;    // 使用 secret 中的凭证去清理外部数据库...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 危险模式：清理逻辑依赖同 namespace 的 Secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reconciler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cleanup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    secret </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Secret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 如果 namespace 正在删除，这个 Secret 可能已经不存在了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ObjectKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Namespace: db.Namespace,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Name: db.Spec.CredentialsRef,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }, secret)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 永远失败 → 永远卡住</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 使用 secret 中的凭证去清理外部数据库...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>解决方案</strong>：将清理所需的关键信息（如外部资源 ID、连接凭证）存储在 CR 的 Status 或 Annotation 中，而非依赖外部引用。</p>\n<p><strong>死锁场景二：Operator 自身不可用</strong></p>\n<p>如果 Operator Pod 被删除或升级期间不可用，带有 Finalizer 的 CR 将卡在 Terminating 状态。这是 Finalizer 的固有风险——必须确保 Operator 具有高可用性（多副本 + Leader Election）。</p>\n<p><strong>死锁场景三：权限不足</strong></p>\n<p>Operator 的 ServiceAccount 缺少删除外部资源的权限。RBAC marker 中必须包含清理所需的所有权限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ownerreference-与级联删除\">OwnerReference 与级联删除</h2><p>OwnerReference 建立父子关系——当父资源被删除时，Kubernetes 的 Garbage Collector 自动删除子资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 设置 OwnerReference：Database 拥有 StatefulSet&#10;func (r *Reconciler) createStatefulSet(ctx context.Context, db *databasev1.Database) error {&#10;    sts := &amp;appsv1.StatefulSet{&#10;        ObjectMeta: metav1.ObjectMeta{&#10;            Name:      db.Name + &quot;-primary&quot;,&#10;            Namespace: db.Namespace,&#10;        },&#10;        Spec: buildStatefulSetSpec(db),&#10;    }&#10;    // 设置 Owner——当 Database CR 被删除时，StatefulSet 自动级联删除&#10;    if err := controllerutil.SetControllerReference(db, sts, r.Scheme); err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;    return r.Create(ctx, sts)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置 OwnerReference：Database 拥有 StatefulSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Reconciler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createStatefulSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">db</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appsv1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatefulSet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ObjectMeta: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">metav1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ObjectMeta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Name:      db.Name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"-primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Namespace: db.Namespace,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Spec: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">buildStatefulSetSpec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 设置 Owner——当 Database CR 被删除时，StatefulSet 自动级联删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controllerutil.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetControllerReference</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(db, sts, r.Scheme); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, sts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>SetControllerReference</code></td>\n<td>设置为 controller owner（唯一，触发调谐）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SetOwnerReference</code></td>\n<td>设置为普通 owner（可多个，仅级联删除）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Controller Owner 的特殊性</strong>：一个对象只能有一个 Controller Owner（<code>controller: true</code> 在 OwnerReference 中）。Controller Owner 的变更会触发子资源的调谐——这是 <code>Owns()</code> watch 的工作原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"级联删除策略\">级联删除策略</h2><p>Kubernetes 支持三种级联删除策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Foreground&#10;        F1[父标记 deletionTimestamp] --&gt; F2[子资源先删除]&#10;        F2 --&gt; F3[所有子资源删完后父删除]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Background&#10;        B1[父立即删除] --&gt; B2[GC 异步删除子资源]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Orphan&#10;        O1[父删除] --&gt; O2[子资源保留, 移除 OwnerRef]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Foreground\n        F1[父标记 deletionTimestamp] --&gt; F2[子资源先删除]\n        F2 --&gt; F3[所有子资源删完后父删除]\n    end\n    subgraph Background\n        B1[父立即删除] --&gt; B2[GC 异步删除子资源]\n    end\n    subgraph Orphan\n        O1[父删除] --&gt; O2[子资源保留, 移除 OwnerRef]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Background</code></td>\n<td>父先删，子异步清理（默认）</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Foreground</code></td>\n<td>子先删完，父才删</td>\n<td>需要确保子资源先停止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Orphan</code></td>\n<td>父删除，子保留</td>\n<td>需要保留数据卷等持久资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Operator 可以通过在删除操作中指定 <code>PropagationPolicy</code> 控制行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 前台级联删除：等所有子资源删完再删父资源&#10;deletePolicy := metav1.DeletePropagationForeground&#10;r.Delete(ctx, parentObj, &amp;client.DeleteOptions{&#10;    PropagationPolicy: &amp;deletePolicy,&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 前台级联删除：等所有子资源删完再删父资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deletePolicy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> metav1.DeletePropagationForeground</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, parentObj, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DeleteOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PropagationPolicy: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deletePolicy,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"finalizer-与-ownerreference-的协作\">Finalizer 与 OwnerReference 的协作</h2><p>两者解决不同层面的清理需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OwnerReference</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 集群内子资源的级联</td>\n<td>StatefulSet、Service、ConfigMap 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finalizer</td>\n<td>外部资源或跨集群资源的清理</td>\n<td>云数据库实例、DNS 记录、外部监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>最佳实践组合</strong>：对集群内子资源使用 OwnerReference（自动级联，无需手动清理），对外部资源使用 Finalizer（确保在 CR 删除前清理）。不要将两者混用在同一资源上——OwnerReference 已经保证了级联删除，再加 Finalizer 只会引入不必要的复杂性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨-namespace-的所有权\">跨 Namespace 的所有权</h2><p>OwnerReference 有一个重要限制：<strong>owner 和 owned 必须在同一 namespace</strong>（cluster-scoped 资源可以拥有任何 namespace 的资源）。当 Operator 需要管理跨 namespace 的资源时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>不能使用 OwnerReference</li>\n<li>必须使用 Finalizer + 手动清理逻辑</li>\n<li>通过 Label/Annotation 建立逻辑关联</li>\n<li>Controller 通过 Watch + MapFunc 追踪跨 namespace 的子资源</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Finalizer 和 OwnerReference 构成 Operator 资源生命周期管理的基础。对集群内子资源使用 OwnerReference 获得自动级联删除；对外部资源使用 Finalizer 确保删除前清理。Finalizer 的常见陷阱包括清理逻辑依赖已删除的资源（导致死锁）、Operator 不可用时阻塞删除、以及权限不足无法清理。设计时应将清理所需信息存储在 CR 自身（Status/Annotation），避免依赖可能先被删除的外部引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"status-conditions\">Status Conditions 设计协议</a>——清理过程中的状态报告</li>\n<li><a href=\"multi-cluster-operators\">多集群 Operator 架构</a>——跨集群资源所有权的挑战</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Finalizers 与所有权管理","id":"finalizers-与所有权管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Finalizer 工作原理","id":"finalizer-工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"Reconciler 中的 Finalizer 模式","id":"reconciler-中的-finalizer-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Finalizer 的常见陷阱","id":"finalizer-的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"OwnerReference 与级联删除","id":"ownerreference-与级联删除"},{"level":2,"text":"级联删除策略","id":"级联删除策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Finalizer 与 OwnerReference 的协作","id":"finalizer-与-ownerreference-的协作"},{"level":2,"text":"跨 Namespace 的所有权","id":"跨-namespace-的所有权"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Status Conditions 设计协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/status-conditions"},"next":{"title":"多集群 Operator 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/multi-cluster-operators"}}